{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The journey continues. The Black Knight once more gets drawn into a tale of mystery, betrayal, and ancient powers. Old friends return, new allies join, and the path leads far beyond what destiny ever intended.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a classic jRPG experience with retro-inspired visuals, side-view turn-based battles, and a story that blends timeless fantasy with science run amok. Explore diverse regions, uncover secrets, and test your skills against powerful foes that threaten the balance of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for a story of courage and sacrifice, where every step forward reveals deeper truths. The Black Knight\u2019s quest is far from over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838470/extras/a1bd02660f1610a6c6423c995364670f.avif?t=1764887692\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A larger, richer adventure \u2014 nearly twice the size of the first game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Side-view, turn-based combat refined for smooth pacing and strategic depth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even more puzzle-focused dungeons filled with meaningful challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many side quests that shape the world and its characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return of the <i>Ancient Cave</i> \u2014 now expanded to 70 floors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New music composed by Alexander Ehlers, continuing the orchestral and electronic fusion of the series.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3838470?t=1764887692","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838470/c8ab97d59b182423d6e9c8fc0386f11949c7844e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=17